*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%================================================================
*%  Brother HL-1210W series - native CUPS raster driver
*%
*%  Independent, open driver; not produced or endorsed by Brother.
*%  Every setting below is carried to the filter in the raster page
*%  header (HWResolution, cupsMediaType, cupsInteger0-5), so the
*%  standard macOS print dialog is all that is needed.
*%================================================================
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "@VERSION@"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "HL1210WN.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Brother"
*Product: "(HL-1210W series)"
*Product: "(Brother HL-1210W series)"
*ModelName: "Brother HL-1210W series"
*ShortNickName: "Brother HL-1210W native"
*NickName: "Brother HL-1210W series - native open driver @VERSION@"
*PSVersion: "(3010.106) 3"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Brother;CMD:PJL,HBP;MDL:HL-1210W series;CLS:PRINTER;"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "20"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42

*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsModelNumber: 9
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsMaxCopies: 999
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 @FILTER_PATH@"
*cupsSNMPSupplies: True
*cupsLanguages: "en"
@ICON_LINE@

*%==== Media sizes ===============================================
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 17 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5Rotated/A5 Long Edge: "<</PageSize[595 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize ISOB5/B5: "<</PageSize[499 709]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/JIS B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize FanFoldGermanLegal/Folio: "<</PageSize[612 936]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 210x270mm/210 x 270 mm: "<</PageSize[595 765]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 195x270mm/16K (195 x 270 mm): "<</PageSize[553 765]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 184x260mm/16K (184 x 260 mm): "<</PageSize[522 737]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 197x273mm/16K (197 x 273 mm): "<</PageSize[558 774]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 17 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5Rotated/A5 Long Edge: "<</PageSize[595 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion ISOB5/B5: "<</PageSize[499 709]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/JIS B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion FanFoldGermanLegal/Folio: "<</PageSize[612 936]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 210x270mm/210 x 270 mm: "<</PageSize[595 765]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 195x270mm/16K (195 x 270 mm): "<</PageSize[553 765]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 184x260mm/16K (184 x 260 mm): "<</PageSize[522 737]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 197x273mm/16K (197 x 273 mm): "<</PageSize[558 774]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "12 12 583 830"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "12 12 600 780"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "12 12 600 996"
*ImageableArea Executive/Executive: "12 12 510 744"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "12 12 408 583"
*ImageableArea A5Rotated/A5 Long Edge: "12 12 583 408"
*ImageableArea ISOB5/B5: "12 12 487 697"
*ImageableArea B5/JIS B5: "12 12 504 717"
*ImageableArea FanFoldGermanLegal/Folio: "12 12 600 924"
*ImageableArea 210x270mm/210 x 270 mm: "12 12 583 753"
*ImageableArea 195x270mm/16K (195 x 270 mm): "12 12 541 753"
*ImageableArea 184x260mm/16K (184 x 260 mm): "12 12 510 725"
*ImageableArea 197x273mm/16K (197 x 273 mm): "12 12 546 762"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Executive/Executive: "522 756"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension A5Rotated/A5 Long Edge: "595 420"
*PaperDimension ISOB5/B5: "499 709"
*PaperDimension B5/JIS B5: "516 729"
*PaperDimension FanFoldGermanLegal/Folio: "612 936"
*PaperDimension 210x270mm/210 x 270 mm: "595 765"
*PaperDimension 195x270mm/16K (195 x 270 mm): "553 765"
*PaperDimension 184x260mm/16K (184 x 260 mm): "522 737"
*PaperDimension 197x273mm/16K (197 x 273 mm): "558 774"

*%==== Custom sizes ==============================================
*VariablePaperSize: True
*LeadingEdge Short: ""
*DefaultLeadingEdge: Short
*MaxMediaWidth: "612"
*MaxMediaHeight: "1008"
*HWMargins: 12 12 12 12
*NonUIOrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *CustomPageSize
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*End
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 420 612
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 420 1008
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*%==== Resolution ================================================
*%  cupsInteger0 = 1 asks the filter to smooth a 300 dpi rendering
*%  up to 600 dpi (the Brother driver's own "600 dpi" method).
*OpenUI *BRResolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 11 AnySetup *BRResolution
*DefaultBRResolution: 600dpi
*BRResolution 300dpi/300 dpi (Draft): "<</HWResolution[300 300]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsInteger0 0>>setpagedevice"
*BRResolution 600dpiSmooth/600 dpi (Fast, smoothed from 300 dpi): "<</HWResolution[300 300]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsInteger0 1>>setpagedevice"
*BRResolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsInteger0 0>>setpagedevice"
*BRResolution 1200dpi/HQ 1200: "<</HWResolution[1200 1200]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsInteger0 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *BRResolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi

*%==== Media type ================================================
*OpenUI *MediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 28 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: Plain
*MediaType Plain/Plain Paper: "<</cupsMediaType 1>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Recycled/Recycled Paper: "<</cupsMediaType 10>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*%==== Graphics quality (halftone screen) ========================
*OpenUI *BRHalfTonePattern/Graphics Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 22 AnySetup *BRHalfTonePattern
*DefaultBRHalfTonePattern: Graphics
*BRHalfTonePattern Graphics/Graphics: "<</cupsInteger1 0>>setpagedevice"
*BRHalfTonePattern Text/Text: "<</cupsInteger1 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *BRHalfTonePattern

*%==== Toner save ================================================
*OpenUI *TonerSaveMode/Toner Save Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 23 AnySetup *TonerSaveMode
*DefaultTonerSaveMode: OFF
*TonerSaveMode OFF/Off: "<</cupsInteger2 0>>setpagedevice"
*TonerSaveMode ON/On: "<</cupsInteger2 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *TonerSaveMode

*%==== Improve print output ======================================
*OpenUI *BRImproveOutput/Improve Print Output: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *BRImproveOutput
*DefaultBRImproveOutput: OFF
*BRImproveOutput OFF/Off: "<</cupsInteger3 0>>setpagedevice"
*BRImproveOutput BRLessPaperCurl/Reduce Paper Curl: "<</cupsInteger3 1>>setpagedevice"
*BRImproveOutput BRFixIntensity/Improve Toner Fixing: "<</cupsInteger3 2>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *BRImproveOutput

*%==== Skip blank pages ==========================================
*OpenUI *BRSkipBlank/Skip Blank Pages: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 31 AnySetup *BRSkipBlank
*DefaultBRSkipBlank: OFF
*BRSkipBlank OFF/Off: "<</cupsInteger4 0>>setpagedevice"
*BRSkipBlank ON/On: "<</cupsInteger4 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *BRSkipBlank

*%==== Density ===================================================
*%  cupsInteger5 = 0 leaves the printer's own setting alone,
*%  otherwise it is the density (-6 .. +6) plus 100.
*OpenUI *BRDensityAdjustment/Density Adjustment: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 33 AnySetup *BRDensityAdjustment
*DefaultBRDensityAdjustment: Default
*BRDensityAdjustment Default/Printer Default: "<</cupsInteger5 0>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Minus6/-6 (Lightest): "<</cupsInteger5 94>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Minus5/-5: "<</cupsInteger5 95>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Minus4/-4: "<</cupsInteger5 96>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Minus3/-3: "<</cupsInteger5 97>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Minus2/-2: "<</cupsInteger5 98>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Minus1/-1: "<</cupsInteger5 99>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Zero/0: "<</cupsInteger5 100>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Plus1/+1: "<</cupsInteger5 101>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Plus2/+2: "<</cupsInteger5 102>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Plus3/+3: "<</cupsInteger5 103>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Plus4/+4: "<</cupsInteger5 104>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Plus5/+5: "<</cupsInteger5 105>>setpagedevice"
*BRDensityAdjustment Plus6/+6 (Darkest): "<</cupsInteger5 106>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *BRDensityAdjustment

*%==== Fonts =====================================================
*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font AvantGarde-Book: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font AvantGarde-BookOblique: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font AvantGarde-Demi: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font AvantGarde-DemiOblique: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Bookman-Demi: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Bookman-DemiItalic: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Bookman-Light: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Bookman-LightItalic: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-Bold: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-BoldOblique: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-Oblique: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-Bold: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-BoldOblique: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-Narrow: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-Narrow-Bold: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-Narrow-BoldOblique: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-Narrow-Oblique: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-Oblique: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font NewCenturySchlbk-Bold: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font NewCenturySchlbk-BoldItalic: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font NewCenturySchlbk-Italic: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font NewCenturySchlbk-Roman: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Palatino-Bold: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Palatino-BoldItalic: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Palatino-Italic: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Palatino-Roman: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Symbol: Special "(001.005)" Special ROM
*Font Times-Bold: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-BoldItalic: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Italic: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font ZapfChancery-MediumItalic: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font ZapfDingbats: Special "(001.005)" Special ROM
*% End of HL1210WN.PPD
